---
import PageRail from './PageRail.astro';
import LVSImage from './LVSImage.astro';
const sections=[['before-after','Before & after'],['website','Website'],['identity','Logos & page headers'],['catalog','Product images'],['production','Custom design'],['flyers','Flyers']];
const brand=[['lvs-logo-black','Primary shield and wordmark']];
const cards=[['lvs-case-core-brand','Custom page hero / Core identity'],['lvs-case-first-aid','Custom page hero / First aid'],['lvs-product-1','Alternate shield / Light composition'],['lvs-product-2','Alternate shield / Dark composition']];
const flyers=[['lvs-case-flyer-black','Black / Launch flyer'],['lvs-case-flyer-white','White / Launch flyer'],['lvs-case-flyer-photo','Photography / Launch flyer']];
---
<article class="lvs-case">
<header class="zn-page-hero lvs-hero"><div class="wrap hero-grid"><div><p class="kick">ZINC / Las Vegas, Nevada</p><h1 class="disp">Las Vegas<br/>Safety<span>&amp; Supply.</span></h1><p class="hero-lede">A storefront rebuilt.<br/>An identity built out.<br/>The detail, done by hand.</p><a class="arrow" href="#before-after">See the transformation ↓</a></div><div class="hero-art" aria-label="Original Las Vegas Safety website and launch artwork"><div class="hero-flyer"><LVSImage k="lvs-case-flyer-photo" alt="Original Las Vegas Safety restaurant-supply launch flyer" sizes="(max-width: 800px) 42vw, 20vw" loading="eager"/></div><div class="hero-storefront"><div class="hero-art-label"><span>Las Vegas Safety &amp; Supply</span><span>Original ZINC website</span></div><LVSImage k="lvs-case-devices-restaurant" alt="Original ZINC restaurant storefront on desktop, laptop, tablet and phone" sizes="(max-width: 800px) 85vw, 48vw" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" widths={[480,640,960,1440,1920]}/></div><span class="hero-art-caption">Website / Identity / Design &amp; production</span></div></div></header>
<PageRail path="/work/las-vegas-safety/" title="Las Vegas Safety & Supply"/>
<nav class="case-nav wrap" aria-label="Las Vegas Safety case study sections">{sections.map(([id,label])=><a href={'#'+id}>{label}</a>)}</nav>
<section id="before-after" class="section comparison"><div class="wrap"><div class="heading"><div><p class="kick">01 / Before &amp; after</p><h2 class="disp">A different<br/>standard.</h2></div><p>The starting point was a generic storefront with placeholder messaging. ZINC rebuilt the website around the actual business: restaurant supplies, first aid and workplace safety.</p></div><div class="compare-grid"><figure><div class="figure-label"><span>Before</span><small>Starting website / December 2024</small></div><LVSImage k="lvs-case-before" alt="Before ZINC: a generic medical storefront with placeholder headline and copy"/><figcaption>Generic imagery, placeholder copy and a template-led opening.</figcaption></figure><figure><div class="figure-label"><span>After</span><small>ZINC’s delivered restaurant storefront</small></div><LVSImage k="lvs-case-delivered-restaurant" alt="ZINC’s delivered restaurant storefront in the owner-supplied laptop presentation"/><figcaption>The delivered restaurant storefront: shield identity, category navigation and restaurant photography.</figcaption></figure></div><p class="archive-note">This case study presents ZINC’s original website and design work from 2024–2025.</p></div></section>
<section class="commitment section"><div class="wrap commitment-grid"><div><p class="kick">The work behind the work</p><h2 class="disp">Beyond the<br/>original scope.</h2></div><div><p class="intro">Multiple logo builds. Custom site cards. Every product image manually upscaled and its background removed.</p><p>The project became an intensive design effort, spanning the storefront, product catalog, service graphics and launch materials. Custom page headers, hero graphics, site cards and footers were all designed for the business. This additional work went beyond the original scope, at no extra charge.</p><div class="deadline"><span>December 24, 2024</span><p>Christmas Eve in the office,<br/>working to meet the deadlines.</p></div></div></div></section>
<section id="website" class="section website" data-case-pages="las-vegas-safety"><div class="wrap"><div class="heading"><div><p class="kick">02 / The website ZINC built</p><h2 class="disp">One identity.<br/>Across screens.</h2></div><p>Restaurant photography and the shield mark carry the original storefront. Category navigation, search, account access and quick reorder give business buyers a practical way into the catalog.</p></div><figure class="device-board" data-case-mockup="las-vegas-safety"><LVSImage k="lvs-case-devices-restaurant" alt="ZINC’s original Las Vegas Safety restaurant website on desktop, laptop, tablet and phone" sizes="90vw"/><figcaption>Original restaurant-led storefront / Desktop, laptop, tablet and mobile</figcaption></figure><div class="website-notes"><div><h3>Designed for each screen</h3><p>The work included separate desktop, tablet and mobile compositions, with a custom mobile header and adjustments to the backgrounds and graphics.</p></div><div><h3>The delivered storefront</h3><p>The restaurant-led design brings the shield, wordmark and supply categories into one clear opening, with account and quick-reorder links above the main navigation.</p></div></div></div></section>
<section id="identity" class="section"><div class="wrap"><div class="heading"><div><p class="kick">03 / Logos &amp; custom page headers</p><h2 class="disp">Built. Refined.<br/>Built out.</h2></div><p>Multiple logo builds explored the shield, cross, wordmark, contrast and layout. The resulting variations extended across first aid, AEDs, training and chemicals, with light and dark treatments for different uses.</p></div><div class="logo-grid">{brand.map(([k,label])=><figure><LVSImage k={k} alt={label+' for Las Vegas Safety'} sizes="(max-width: 800px) 90vw, 29vw"/><figcaption>{label}</figcaption></figure>)}</div><figure id="custom-graphics" class="work-board"><div class="board-crop"><LVSImage k="lvs-case-brand-board" alt="December 2024 working board showing shield, wordmark and diagonal background variations" sizes="90vw"/></div><figcaption>Custom graphics by ZINC / Page headers, shield variations and diagonal backgrounds</figcaption></figure><p>Custom page heroes and headers carried the identity through the site. ZINC designed the graphics, variations and backgrounds as part of the additional work supplied at no extra charge.</p><div class="card-grid">{cards.map(([k,label])=><figure><LVSImage k={k} alt={'Las Vegas Safety '+label}/><figcaption>{label}</figcaption></figure>)}</div></div></section>
<section id="catalog" class="section catalog"><div class="wrap"><div class="heading"><div><p class="kick">04 / Product-image production</p><h2 class="disp">Every image.<br/>By hand.</h2></div><div><p class="intro">ZINC manually upscaled every product image and removed its background across the catalog.</p><p>That work sat behind the storefront: preparing individual products, cleaning their presentation and bringing the catalog imagery into the site’s visual direction.</p></div></div><div class="product-grid"><figure><LVSImage k="lvs-case-product-board" alt="Original working board with isolated safety products, gloves and shield variations"/><figcaption>Production board / Isolated products and identity variations</figcaption></figure><figure><LVSImage k="lvs-food-service-product-hero" alt="Original Las Vegas Safety food-service artwork with containers, gloves and hair nets"/><figcaption>Product artwork / Food-service supplies</figcaption></figure></div><div class="process"><div><span>01 / Enlarge</span><p>Manually upscale the supplied product images.</p></div><div><span>02 / Isolate</span><p>Remove backgrounds by hand, product by product.</p></div><div><span>03 / Prepare</span><p>Bring the finished images into catalog and site artwork.</p></div></div></div></section>
<section id="production" class="section"><div class="wrap"><div class="heading"><div><p class="kick">05 / Custom design &amp; production</p><h2 class="disp">The details<br/>add up.</h2></div><p>Custom cards, layered backgrounds, service graphics and footer treatments demanded their own design work. The December production files show that attention continuing through the page layouts and responsive versions.</p></div><div class="production-grid"><figure><LVSImage k="lvs-case-footer-progress" alt="December 20 production recording still showing custom diagonal page and footer alignment"/><figcaption>December 20, 2024 / Custom background and footer alignment in progress</figcaption></figure><div class="production-copy"><h3>Custom cards, beyond the brief</h3><p>ZINC created custom cards within the website in addition to the original scope. They were part of the extra design work completed at no additional charge.</p><h3>Custom footers</h3><p>ZINC designed the footer treatments specifically for this site, at no extra charge. Diagonal blocks, red accents and the shield tied the content sections to the footer. Desktop, tablet and mobile layouts each received their own treatment.</p><h3>Sustained production</h3><p>The work continued through repeated logo builds, catalog-image preparation and layout refinements, including Christmas Eve in the office to meet deadlines.</p></div></div><figure class="safety-board"><LVSImage k="lvs-case-devices-safety" alt="Mid-project first-aid website version across devices" sizes="90vw"/><figcaption>Mid-project version / First-aid composition</figcaption></figure><figure class="footer-board"><LVSImage k="lvs-case-footer" alt="Original ZINC website footer with diagonal backgrounds and central red shield" sizes="90vw"/><figcaption>Custom footer by ZINC / Diagonal composition, central shield and branded contact area</figcaption></figure></div></section>
<section id="flyers" class="section flyers"><div class="wrap"><div class="heading"><div><p class="kick">06 / Launch collateral</p><h2 class="disp">Off screen.<br/>Still connected.</h2></div><p>The same identity carried into restaurant-safety flyers. Black, white and photographic versions brought the supply categories, website address and QR code into a consistent set of materials.</p></div><div class="flyer-grid">{flyers.map(([k,label])=><figure><LVSImage k={k} alt={'Las Vegas Safety '+label} sizes="(max-width: 800px) 90vw, 29vw"/><figcaption>{label}</figcaption></figure>)}</div><figure class="archive-presentation"><LVSImage k="lvs-case-zinc-presentation" alt="Original ZINC portfolio artwork showing the restaurant storefront on desktop, tablet and phone" sizes="(max-width: 800px) 90vw, 65vw"/><figcaption>From ZINC’s archive / Original website presentation</figcaption></figure><div class="closing"><p>A website, an identity and a catalog shaped through extensive hands-on design work.</p><a class="arrow" href="/work/">← Explore more work</a></div></div></section>
</article>
<style>
.lvs-case{background:#f2f1ee;color:#181a1c;--ink:#181a1c;--muted:#555;--line:#d2d2d0}.lvs-hero{padding:75px 0;background:radial-gradient(ellipse at 95% 30%,#3b101a,transparent 60%),#080b0e;color:#faf9f5}.hero-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1.2fr;gap:45px;align-items:center}.lvs-hero h1{font-size:clamp(72px,9vw,140px);line-height:.94;letter-spacing:-.035em;margin:30px 0}.lvs-hero h1 span{display:block;color:#e85167;font-size:.65em;line-height:1.2}.hero-lede{font-size:22px;line-height:1.5;color:#ddd}.lvs-hero a{color:#fff}.lvs-hero .kick{color:#ccc}.hero-art{position:relative;min-width:0;aspect-ratio:1.1;isolation:isolate}.hero-flyer{position:absolute;top:0;right:7%;width:40%;transform:rotate(7deg);box-shadow:0 24px 60px #0009;border:5px solid #f7f5f0}.hero-storefront{position:absolute;left:0;bottom:13%;width:94%;background:#fff;padding:22px 18px 30px;box-shadow:0 25px 70px #0008;transform:rotate(-5deg);border:1px solid #ddd}.hero-art-label{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:15px;font:9px/1.5 var(--fm);color:#555;margin-bottom:24px}.hero-art-label span:first-child{max-width:18ch}.hero-art-caption{position:absolute;bottom:0;left:5%;font:10px/1.6 var(--fm);color:#d5d0d0;letter-spacing:.04em}.case-nav{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px 30px;padding-block:25px;border-bottom:1px solid #ccc}.case-nav a{font:12px/1.6 var(--fm);padding:7px 0;color:#292929}.section{padding:80px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #d3d3d0;scroll-margin-top:80px}.section h2{font-size:clamp(50px,6vw,92px);line-height:.98;margin:20px 0 28px}.section p{font-size:17px;line-height:1.7;max-width:59ch}.lvs-case .commitment .kick{color:#ccc}.lvs-case .kick{font:11px/1.6 var(--fm)}.heading{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:50px;align-items:end;margin-bottom:35px}.heading>p{margin-bottom:25px}.compare-grid,.product-grid,.production-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:28px}.lvs-case figure{margin:0;min-width:0}.compare-grid figure,.logo-grid figure,.card-grid figure,.product-grid figure,.flyer-grid figure{background:#fff;border:1px solid #d7d7d5;padding:18px}.figure-label{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-bottom:18px}.figure-label>span{font-size:27px;font-weight:600}.figure-label small{font:10px/1.6 var(--fm);color:#555}.lvs-case figcaption{font:11px/1.7 var(--fm);color:#555;padding-top:18px;margin-top:18px;border-top:1px solid #ddd}.compare-grid :global(img){aspect-ratio:1.88;object-fit:contain}.lvs-case .archive-note{font:12px/1.8 var(--fm);color:#555;max-width:none;margin-top:25px}.commitment{background:#181a1d;color:#f4f3ef}.commitment-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1.1fr;gap:55px}.section .intro{font-size:26px;line-height:1.5}.deadline{border-left:3px solid #e85167;padding:12px 0 12px 25px;margin-top:35px}.deadline>span{font:11px var(--fm);color:#e8a5b0}.deadline>p{font-size:28px;line-height:1.35;margin-bottom:0}.website{background:white}.device-board{background:#fff;padding:3% 1%}.website-notes{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:50px;margin:35px 0}.section h3{font-size:24px;font-weight:500;line-height:1.3}.safety-board{padding:4% 7%;background:#fff;border:1px solid #ddd}.logo-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:24px}.logo-grid :global(img){height:190px;object-fit:contain}.work-board{scroll-margin-top:95px;margin-top:35px!important;background:#fff;padding:18px}.board-crop{aspect-ratio:2048/770;overflow:hidden}.board-crop :global(.original-image),.board-crop :global(picture){display:block;height:100%}.board-crop :global(img){height:100%;object-fit:cover;object-position:50% 40.7%}.card-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:24px;margin-top:30px}.card-grid :global(img){aspect-ratio:2;object-fit:contain}.catalog{background:#e8e7e2}.product-grid :global(img){aspect-ratio:1.3;object-fit:contain}.process{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:35px;margin-top:35px}.process span{font:12px var(--fm)}.process p{font-size:16px}.production-grid{align-items:center;gap:45px}.production-copy h3:first-child{margin-top:0}.production-copy p{font-size:16px}.production-grid+.safety-board{margin-top:35px}.footer-board{margin-top:40px!important;padding:18px;background:#fff}.flyers{background:#fff}.flyer-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:25px}.flyer-grid :global(img){aspect-ratio:4830/6250;object-fit:contain}.archive-presentation{max-width:850px;margin:55px auto 0!important}.closing{padding-top:50px;margin-top:45px;border-top:1px solid #ccc}.closing>p{font-size:clamp(28px,4vw,50px);line-height:1.2;max-width:30ch}.lvs-case a:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #009398;outline-offset:5px}@media(max-width:800px){.hero-grid,.heading,.commitment-grid,.compare-grid,.product-grid,.production-grid,.website-notes{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:25px}.lvs-hero{padding:45px 0}.lvs-hero h1{font-size:clamp(68px,14vw,108px)}.hero-art{width:100%;max-width:640px;margin:25px auto 0;aspect-ratio:1.1}.hero-storefront{padding:15px 12px 22px}.hero-art-label{font-size:8px;margin-bottom:18px}.hero-art-caption{font-size:9px}.section{padding:50px 0}.heading>p{margin-top:0}.section .intro{font-size:23px}.logo-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.logo-grid :global(img){height:150px}.card-grid{gap:16px}.process{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:15px}.process>div{border-top:1px solid #bbb;padding-top:20px}.flyer-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.flyer-grid figure{max-width:530px;width:100%;margin-inline:auto}.deadline>p{font-size:24px}.safety-board{padding:20px}.card-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.lvs-case figcaption{font-size:10px}}
</style>
